    "460d6567-b3ab-4cca-8b8a-bddf9a7a02e4": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14831909634118__460d6567-b3ab-4cca-8b8a-bddf9a7a02e4-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "testimonial_text": "<p>\"To my horror after 4 years of literally daily abuse my water bottle sprung a leak. SilverAnt's lifetime warranty is legit and they replaced it without any questions.<br/><br/>Theirs are the kind of products that are designed to be used, and used hard. They draw eyes and start conversations. Since buying my water bottle I've had to go back and buy more several times... because my relatives keep requesting them as gifts...\"</p>",
            "customer_name": "Sparks",
            "link": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/665945efe2088d0d71c66628"
          }
        },
        "6b1f201a-d276-4a03-b93f-6b3727c8ef38": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "testimonial_text": "<p>\"Outstanding customer service, changed my order when I made a mistake. Then, the products arrived and they kick A$s! Bomber tent stakes that stay put in all kinds of terrain (at least in the Sierra).\"</p>",
            "customer_name": "Tahoe Grace",
            "link": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/66c51e9ef24f01b87bb6ffa8"
          }
        },
        "040df02c-88a3-42b1-a37f-8d1e0b88f018": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "testimonial_text": "<p>\"I have purchased my SilverAnt items through Amazon in the past and I have always been impressed by the level of quality, fit and finish of each item. Recently I ordered directly from them. I had an issue with the cross stands being two of the same piece. I reached out to them and immediately got a response. They mailed me the two complementary pieces for the cross stand so now I have two cross stands. Quality issues can happen with any company but their excellent customer service is what sets them apart. I would recommend their products to anyone.\"</p>",
            "customer_name": "Mike Lapointe",
            "link": "https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/684ab7556938c2f49b84f068"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "template--14831909634118__460d6567-b3ab-4cca-8b8a-bddf9a7a02e4-text-1",
        "6b1f201a-d276-4a03-b93f-6b3727c8ef38",
