    "accordion_tL4Ry7": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_content_TWfebE": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where are the products manufactured?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>All our products are manufactured in the south of China. For the past 25+ years, we have been producing titanium outdoor gear for international outdoor brands, and in 2018, we created our own brand, SilverAnt Outdoors. All our products are made inside our ISO:9001-2015 certified manufacturing facility. In addition, all our products are certified by the FDA, SGS, and the Japanese Food Standards Agency. We also regularly test our raw titanium for purity. To see our accreditations, please just reach out and <a href=\"https://silverantoutdoors.com/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://silverantoutdoors.com/pages/contact-us\">contact us</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_content_XpYFwd": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long is the product warranty?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>All products are covered by a lifetime warranty, apart from our tent stakes. We base each warranty case individually, depending on the reason for damage and the cause. Additional costs may be incurred for shipping and repairs should the damage not be caused by issues with the product's integrity.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_content_aex9UG": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is your return policy?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>If you are unsatisfied with your product order please contact us immediately at <a href=\"mailto:info@silverantoutdoors.com\">info@silverantoutdoors.com</a>. We offer a 30-day return policy for all products from the date of delivery, providing proof of receipt. For damage or to repair based on the lifetime warranty, please contact us to organise sending the product back to us for repair or replacement.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_content_errhth": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the titanium coated?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>No, we do not coat our titanium products. We believe in maintaining the integrity of the titanium, ensuring a lifetime of use and protecting the antibacterial, non-allergenic and non-toxic properties. Sandblasting is powered by compressed air to form a high-speed jet beam to spray the titanium surface, producing the classic matte finish. Crystallization is a process where the titanium product is put in a vacuum oven at high temperatures and pressure for 10+ hours to produce the finish. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_content_Mk87VY": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the best protocol for cleaning the my titanium gear?",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>We highly recommend never using a dishwasher and only washing with water by hand. Please don’t use an abrasive cloth as this will damage and scratch the titanium and reduce its longevity. Use a fabric cloth with mild detergent, rinse thoroughly, and dry. Then store in your rucksack or cupboard ready for the next adventure.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
